==English==
===Adjective===
'''in kind'''
#{{idiom}} Similar; reciprocal; equivalent.
#:''I made an '''in kind''' donation to the International Rights Association.''

===Adverb===
'''in kind'''
#{{idiom}} In a [[reciprocal]] manner; in a similar way.
#:''I kissed him, and he responded '''in kind''' and kissed me back.''